WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:09.968
When I was a kid, I used to 
watch the Academy Awards

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.177
every single year.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.472
And so I never, ever thought
 I would win an Academy Award.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.726
Just having a moment like this,
being here at the Oscars. 

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:18.935
That is magical.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.729
So I'd say to my younger self,

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:22.355
 “A ll the stories you have to tell,

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.232
 try and tell them, because 
they're the best ones.”

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:26.568
You know,I mean  
I started a long time ago 

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:28.361
when I started projecting 

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:31.072
Mack Sennett pictures
 against the wall of my bedroom.

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:32.824
I’ve been Questlove for 30 years. 

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:37.120
And if you could tell the person
 that used to busk for change

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:41.207
on South Street in Philadelphia
 where his life is headed,

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:42.625
wow.

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:47.297
Well my daughter has grown up
and she saw me as her father

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:50.425
always being busy performing on 
stage at all these various theaters,

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:53.762
and she was trying to understand
what her father was doing.

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:57.098
But I think finally now she's able 
to witness this and come along

00:00:57.098 --> 00:01:00.060
in my journey and come along
on this wild ride with me.

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:02.562
Hey!

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.189
(laughing)

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:05.565
We’re so proud of you. 

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.441
Thanks. Thanks. 

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:07.484
This is cool, right?

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:10.361
How does it feel Aneil?

00:01:10.361 --> 00:01:11.488
Nice. 

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.156
This feels nice. 

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:13.782
Yeah.

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.617
That's how I describe it. 

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:18.161
That is the joy of living
 is experiencing,

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:22.415
new, surprising aspects of life.

00:01:22.665 --> 00:01:25.835
And that's what this is. 

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:27.545
Just believe
 in your dreams. 

00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:29.798
Carry on. Do it. 

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:30.632
Make mistakes. 

00:01:30.632 --> 00:01:32.425
Learn from your mistakes. 

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.719
And don't stop doing it. 

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:47.232
When I came here
 to this country,

00:01:47.816 --> 00:01:51.694
I had an Oscar that I borrowed
 that I put in my office.

00:01:51.903 --> 00:01:54.656
And I was really looking at it
 every day and saying,

00:01:54.864 --> 00:01:56.866
“Maybe one day
 I'd be lucky to get one.”

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.327
One key thing is 
to never give up.

00:01:59.494 --> 00:02:01.287
Never give up for your dreams.

